  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;proposed first-floor rear extension, by reason of its excessive depth and siting, would constitute unacceptable levels of overbearing, loss of outlook, overshadowing and loss of daylight impacts to the adjoining property no.254 Oxlow Lane. The proposed development therefore constitutes unneighbourly development and is contrary to: - National Planning Policy Framework National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024) - Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021); - Policies DMD1 and SP2 of The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024) - The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;div&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;first-floor rear extension, by virtue of its design, scale and siting, would be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;excessive in scale and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;disproportionate to the modest end-of-terrace property which would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the host property and terrace parade.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;-National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Policies D1, D4, D5 and D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -Policies DMD1, DMD5 and SP2 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham&#x27;s Local Plan (September 2024); and&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposed development would fail to comply with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;required minimum space standards for the overall gross internal area&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and would therefore provide a substandard quality of accommodation detrimental to the standard of living of future residents. Therefore, the proposal fails to comply with:&amp;nbsp; National Planning Policy Framework (MHCLG, December 2024); Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021); and&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Technical housing standards – nationally \r\ndescribed space standard (March 2015)&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
